---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Maps & Visualizations
intro: Static maps, map series, interactive maps, and dashboards — hosted here or linked out to wherever they already live.
description: A gallery of maps, map series, interactive web maps, dashboards, and data visualizations by Laura N. Aguilera Martin.
permalink: /maps/index.html
---

{% from "partials/markers.njk" import mapPlaceholder %}

<div class="container section">

  <ul class="map-grid">
    {% for item in maps %}
      <li class="map-item">
        <div class="map-item__media">
          {% if item.image %}
            <img src="{{ item.image | url }}" alt="{{ item.imageAlt }}"
                 loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          {% else %}
            {{ mapPlaceholder() }}
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="map-item__body">
          <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:var(--step-1);margin:0">{{ item.title }}</h2>

          <p>
            {% if item.year %}{{ item.year }}{% endif %}
            {% if item.year and item.software %} · {% endif %}
            {% if item.software %}{{ item.software }}{% endif %}
          </p>

          <p>{{ item.context }}</p>

          {% if item.placeholder %}
            <p><span class="placeholder-note">Placeholder — no map published here yet</span></p>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="map-item__footer">
            {% if item.externalUrl %}
              <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="{{ item.externalUrl }}">
                Open the map
                <span class="external-badge">external</span>
              </a>
            {% endif %}
            {% if item.project %}
              <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="{{ item.project | url }}">{{ item.projectName }}</a>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <div class="aside-card" style="margin-top:var(--space-xl)">
    <h2 style="font-size:var(--step-1)">About this gallery</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-soft)">
      The entries above are placeholders. Maps produced for clients are not
      republished here without permission, so this gallery fills up with work
      that is mine to share.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-bottom:0;color:var(--ink-soft)">
      An entry can be a static image hosted on this site, or a link out to a map
      that already lives somewhere else — ArcGIS Online, ArcGIS StoryMaps,
      Tableau Public, or a Leaflet or MapLibre map on its own domain. Nothing
      here has to be self-hosted.
    </p>
  </div>

</div>
